<div class="page-intro"><span class="coverage-tag">Research preview · not ranked</span><h1>Aion 2 tier list research</h1><p>A single all-purpose ranking would blur together damage, support, survival and group demand. We are keeping this page out of search until the Global evidence can support separate conclusions by mode.</p></div>
