<div class="page-intro"><span class="section-kicker">8 classes · evidence first</span><h1>Aion 2 class research</h1><p>These are not finished meta builds. Each page records only readable skills, orders, macros or test results from a dated source, then calls out the gaps instead of guessing.</p></div>
