page('/guides/beginner-guide','Aion 2 Beginner Guide: Tips for New Players (2026)','Aion 2 beginner guide for new players: how to start free on Steam, picking a faction and server, Stigma and Daevanion basics, and mistakes that get you banned.',[...H,['Guides','/guides'],['Beginner Guide','/guides/beginner-guide']],`
<h1>Aion 2 beginner guide</h1>${mediaFigure(screenshots.fortress,'Promotional flight scene; not a UI instruction.','guide-hero')}<div class="prose">
<h2>Getting in</h2><p>AION 2 is free on Steam and on NC's PURPLE launcher; both share the same servers. Global launch was October 5, 2026 at 6:00 PDT / 15:00 CEST. Early Access servers opened September 30.</p>
<h2>Pick a faction and server</h2><p>Elyos and Asmodians live on separate servers. Each Elyos server is paired with an Asmodian server, and those are the enemies you meet in the Abyss and Spacetime Rifts. Pairings change periodically. Instanced content, including dungeons, is cross-server, so a newer server does not lock you out of group content. New EU servers (Nathara and Tassin) opened on October 8.</p>
<h2>Pick a class</h2><p>See the <a href="/classes">class list</a>. If you want the most documented class right now, the Chanter page has the most sourced detail.</p>
<h2>Systems you will meet early</h2><ul><li><strong>Stigma skills</strong>: extra skills you slot as you level. Slots are reported to open at levels 22, 27, 32 and 37 (not confirmed).</li><li><strong>Daevanion board</strong>: a node board for each class. Creator guides show 300 points spent on a full board (not confirmed).</li><li><strong>Theostones and Manastones</strong>: gear add-ons covered by several creator guides; exact values are (not confirmed).</li></ul>
<h2>Things to avoid</h2><ul><li>Buying currency from third parties. NC has posted warnings and restricts accounts for gold farming, bots, macros run by unauthorized programs and real-money trading.</li><li>Ignoring a security lock. A temporary lock is not a penalty; contact NC Customer Support to restore access.</li></ul>
<h2>Free launch rewards</h2><p>Log in before the December 1 maintenance to collect pre-registration and wishlist rewards. Details in the <a href="/guides/launch-rewards">launch rewards guide</a>.</p>
<p class="src">Sources: official Steam news posts from NC, Oct 4 to Oct 13, 2026. Last checked ${LAST}.</p></div>`,{noindex:true,og:'guide-beginner-guide'});
page('/guides/ariel-daevanion','Aion 2 Ariel Daevanion Guide: Fragments and Board','Aion 2 Ariel Daevanion guide for Global: how Hard Expeditions drop Ariel Fragments, the Crystal morphs, limits, and what NC has not yet documented.',[...H,['Guides','/guides'],['Ariel Daevanion Guide','/guides/ariel-daevanion']],`
<h1>Aion 2 Ariel Daevanion guide</h1>${mediaFigure(screenshots.blueCavern,'Promotional environment scene; not an Ariel board screenshot.','guide-hero')}<div class="prose">
<p>The Ariel Daevanion Board arrived on Global servers in the October 20 PDT / October 21 CEST update. It is a new progression track fed by <strong>Ariel Fragments</strong> from Expedition Hard Mode. This page separates what NC published from route and drop-rate claims that still need in-game confirmation.</p>
<h2>Quick answer</h2><ol><li>Enter Hard Mode for <a href="/guides/expedition-hard-mode">Krao Cave or Draupnir</a>.</li><li>Collect the dungeon-specific Ariel Fragment reward.</li><li>Open <strong>Substance Morph → Special → Daevanion</strong>.</li><li>Morph 100 matching Ariel Fragments into 1 <strong>Daevanion Crystal: Ariel (Bound)</strong>.</li><li>Spend the resulting Ariel point on the new board.</li></ol>
<h2>Fragment morphs and limits</h2><table class="t"><tr><th>Input</th><th>Output</th><th>Published limit</th></tr><tr><td>100 Ariel Fragments</td><td>1 Daevanion Crystal: Ariel (Bound)</td><td>Up to 30 times per character; NC says the limit is tracked for each dungeon</td></tr><tr><td>1 Ariel Fragment</td><td>5 Enhance Stones</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr></table>
<p>Krao Cave and Draupnir award different Ariel Fragments, so fragments from one dungeon should not be assumed to satisfy the other dungeon's morph. NC did not publish the number of fragments per clear or a guaranteed drop rate.</p>
<h2>What the board does</h2><p>NC confirmed that the Ariel Board is new and that its points come from Hard Expedition fragments through Substance Morph. The Global patch note did <strong>not</strong> publish a complete node map, total point cost, best route, or class-by-class priority. Those details remain unconfirmed here until they can be checked against the live Global client.</p>
<h2>Do not copy an old Ariel route blindly</h2><p>Ariel existed in earlier regional versions, but the Global launch did not initially include it. A Korean or Taiwanese route may use a different client version, node value, or progression pace. Check the source date and region before spending points.</p>
<h2>Related rewards</h2><p>Hard Mode also adds Philosopher's Stone: Revelation (Bound), Expedition Hero Artwork, more Kina than Normal, and all three Unique crafting materials: Wrathful Mind, Wrathful Will and Wrathful Ego.</p>
<p class="src">Primary source: NC, <a href="https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027715" rel="noopener nofollow">Patch Notes | Oct. 20 (PDT) / Oct. 21 (CEST)</a>. Last checked ${LAST}.</p></div>`,{noindex:true});
page('/guides/expedition-hard-mode','Aion 2 Expedition Hard Mode: Krao and Draupnir','Aion 2 Expedition Hard Mode guide for Krao Cave and Draupnir: item level, Frenzy timer, revive limit, Ariel Fragments, materials and rewards.',[...H,['Guides','/guides'],['Expedition Hard Mode','/guides/expedition-hard-mode']],`
<h1>Aion 2 Expedition Hard Mode</h1>${mediaFigure(screenshots.fireBoss,'Promotional boss scene; not a Krao Cave or Draupnir mechanic frame.','guide-hero')}<div class="prose">
<p>Global's first Expedition Hard Mode opened for <strong>Krao Cave</strong> and <strong>Draupnir</strong> in the October 20 PDT / October 21 CEST patch. The published rules are strict: item level 2600, a four-minute boss Frenzy timer, and three revives for each player.</p>
<h2>Entry and combat rules</h2><table class="t"><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Hard Mode value</th></tr><tr><td>Available dungeons</td><td>Krao Cave and Draupnir</td></tr><tr><td>Required item level</td><td>2600</td></tr><tr><td>Boss Frenzy timer</td><td>4 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Revive limit</td><td>3 per player</td></tr></table>
<p>NC published an item-level requirement, not a minimum Combat Power target. Party-finder requirements above 2600 are community choices, not an official entry rule.</p>
<h2>Published Hard Mode rewards</h2><ul><li>A chance to obtain <strong>Philosopher's Stone: Revelation (Bound)</strong>.</li><li>Philosopher's Stone: Revelation as a selectable guaranteed reward.</li><li>Dungeon-specific <strong>Ariel Fragment (Bound)</strong> rewards.</li><li>A chance at Expedition Hero Artwork.</li><li>More Kina than Normal difficulty.</li><li>All Unique crafting materials: Wrathful Mind, Wrathful Will and Wrathful Ego.</li><li>Unique Skins from the new Expedition Hard achievements.</li></ul>
<h2>What to do with Ariel Fragments</h2><p>Use <strong>Substance Morph → Special → Daevanion</strong> to turn 100 fragments into one Daevanion Crystal: Ariel. The official note caps that morph at 30 times per character and says the limit is tracked for each dungeon. If you do not want the board point, one fragment can instead become five Enhance Stones without a published morph limit. See the <a href="/guides/ariel-daevanion">Ariel Daevanion guide</a>.</p>
<h2>What is still unknown</h2><p>The patch note does not publish per-clear fragment quantities, reward probabilities, boss mechanics, a recommended Combat Power buffer, or a best party composition. Treat week-one player reports as observations rather than fixed rules.</p>
<p class="src">Primary source: NC, <a href="https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027715" rel="noopener nofollow">Patch Notes | Oct. 20 (PDT) / Oct. 21 (CEST)</a>. Last checked ${LAST}.</p></div>`,{noindex:true});
page('/guides/halloween-event','Aion 2 Halloween Event: Candy Keys and Rewards','Aion 2 Halloween event guide: Candy Key Fragments, red, yellow and blue candy rewards, Pumpkin Coin shop priorities, dates and item removal times.',[...H,['Guides','/guides'],['Halloween Event Guide','/guides/halloween-event']],`
<h1>Aion 2 Halloween event guide</h1>${mediaFigure(screenshots.fieldCombat,'Promotional combat scene; not an event reward screen.','guide-hero')}<div class="prose">
<p>The Global <strong>Trick or Treat</strong> event runs from the October 13 PDT / October 14 CEST maintenance until maintenance on November 3 PDT / November 4 CET. It has three connected parts: a 14-day attendance track, weekly Season Missions, and colored Candy Keys made from dungeon fragments.</p>
<h2>How Candy Keys work</h2><ol><li>Clear Expedition and Transcendence dungeons to earn <strong>Candy Key Fragment (Event)</strong>.</li><li>Open <strong>Substance Morph → Event</strong>.</li><li>Spend 60 fragments on a Red, Yellow or Blue Candy Key.</li><li>Use the matching key on event candy placed in towns.</li></ol>
<p>Each colored key morph is guaranteed and limited to once per week per server. Spare fragments can be converted into 10 Superior Power Shards per fragment with no published limit.</p>
<h2>Red, yellow and blue Candy Key rewards</h2><table class="t"><tr><th>Key</th><th>Main rewards</th><th>Food included</th></tr><tr><td>Red</td><td>20 Growth Pet Chests; 10 Battle Enhance Scrolls</td><td>5 Halloween Candy; 5 Halloween Cookies</td></tr><tr><td>Yellow</td><td>10,000 Abyss Points; 10 Life Crystals</td><td>5 Halloween Candy; 5 Halloween Cookies</td></tr><tr><td>Blue</td><td>4 Odyle Energy; 10 Resurrection Spiritstones</td><td>5 Halloween Candy; 5 Halloween Cookies</td></tr></table>
<h2>Pumpkin Coins and the event merchant</h2><p>Attendance pays 620 Halloween Pumpkin Coins across 14 claimed days. Weekly Season Missions add coins for Abyss kills, dungeons, Ascension Trial, Nightmare, login, obtaining Unique gear, using scrolls, Dimensional Invasion and Shugo Festival.</p>
<table class="t"><tr><th>Faction</th><th>Event merchant towns</th></tr><tr><td>Elyos</td><td>Dawn Legion Base and Zumion Village in Verteron</td></tr><tr><td>Asmodian</td><td>Safe Haven and Nornir Assembly in Altgard</td></tr></table>
<p>The Special Halloween Chest costs 250 coins, is limited to one per server, and contains the Spooky Scary Skeleton breastplate skin plus 10,000 Pet Soul Crystals.</p>
<h2>Expiry warning</h2><p>Halloween Candy, Halloween Cookies, Candy Key Fragments and all three Candy Keys are scheduled for removal on November 3, 2026 at 11:00 PM PST / November 4 at 8:00 AM CET. Use them before the deadline. Some utility rewards, including Odyle Energy and Resurrection Spiritstones, have a later December removal schedule.</p>
<p class="src">Primary source: NC, <a href="https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678483" rel="noopener nofollow">Trick or Treat</a>. Last checked ${LAST}.</p></div>`);
page('/guides/server-transfer','Aion 2 Server Transfer Guide: Dates, Cost and Hours','Aion 2 server transfer guide: Early Access and launch server dates in October, Quna cost per character and slot, and the daily transfer windows for each region.',[...H,['Guides','/guides'],['Server Transfer Guide','/guides/server-transfer']],`
<h1>Aion 2 server transfer guide</h1>${mediaFigure(screenshots.worldBoss,'Promotional combat scene; transfer rules come from the linked NC support page.','guide-hero')}<div class="prose">
<h2>When</h2><ul><li><strong>Early Access servers:</strong> after maintenance on Tuesday Oct 13 PDT / Wednesday Oct 14 CEST, until before maintenance on Oct 20 PDT / Oct 21 CEST.</li><li><strong>Launch servers:</strong> after maintenance on Oct 20 PDT / Oct 21 CEST, until before maintenance on Oct 27 PDT / Oct 28 CET.</li></ul>
<h2>Cost</h2><table class="t"><tr><th>Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Limit</th></tr><tr><td>Base cost</td><td>0 Quna</td><td>Once per account</td></tr><tr><td>Per character transferred</td><td>0 Quna</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Extra character slot on destination</td><td>1,000 Quna per slot</td><td>-</td></tr></table>
<p>Example from the notice: moving 6 characters to a server where only 4 slots are free costs 2,000 Quna for the extra slots.</p>
<h2>Daily windows</h2><table class="t"><tr><th>Region</th><th>PDT</th><th>CEST/CET</th></tr><tr><td>NA East, NA West, South America</td><td>09:00–13:00; 15:00–19:00</td><td>18:00–22:00; next day 00:00–04:00</td></tr><tr><td>Europe</td><td>03:00–07:00; 09:00–13:00</td><td>12:00–16:00; 18:00–22:00</td></tr><tr><td>Asia</td><td>20:00–next day 00:00; 02:00–06:00</td><td>05:00–09:00; 11:00–15:00</td></tr></table>
<p><strong>Special dates:</strong> on October 21 and October 28, the Asia morning window changes to 20:00–23:00 PDT / 05:00–08:00 CEST. For the first round after maintenance on October 21, Europe and Asia start at 05:00 PDT / 14:00 CEST and keep the previously scheduled end time.</p>
<h2>Before you apply</h2><ul><li>Characters must be level 10 or higher and standing in a village.</li><li>Leave your Legion and clear any pending Legion application.</li><li>Finish active Duty Missions and claim Market, Shop Storage and mail items.</li><li>Move anything you need out of Server Storage; its items do not transfer.</li><li>Transfers stay within the same region, faction and server type.</li></ul>
<p class="src">Source: NC, <a href="https://help.plaync.com/faq/aion2global?faqNo=7256" rel="noopener nofollow">Server Transfer Q&amp;A</a> and Server Transfer Products Info. Last checked ${LAST}.</p></div>`,{og:'guide-server-transfer'});
page('/guides/launch-rewards','Aion 2 Launch Rewards: Pre-Registration and Wishlist Items','Aion 2 launch rewards explained: the free Pagati pet chest, every item in the Steam wishlist chest, and the December 1 login deadline to claim them by mail.',[...H,['Guides','/guides'],['Launch Rewards Guide','/guides/launch-rewards']],`
<h1>Aion 2 launch rewards guide</h1>${mediaFigure(screenshots.raidGroup,'Promotional group scene; the reward list comes from the dated NC notice.','guide-hero')}<div class="prose"><p>NC extended the pre-registration and Steam wishlist rewards to every player who creates an account and logs in before maintenance on December 1, 2026 (23:30 PST). Rewards arrive by in-game mail, which expires December 8, 2026 at 23:30 PST.</p>
<h2>Advance: Pet Chest</h2><ul><li>Pet: Pagati</li><li>Pick one of Papis, Silver Blade Rotan, Konutin Worker or Black Smoke Murute</li></ul>
<h2>Advance: Wishlist Chest</h2><table class="t"><tr><th>Item</th><th>Qty</th></tr><tr><td>Resurrection Spiritstone (Bound)</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Life Potion (Bound)</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><td>Healing Potion (Bound)</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Return Scroll (Bound)</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Courage Scroll (Bound)</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Speed Scroll (Bound)</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Benediction Scroll (Bound)</td><td>50</td></tr></table>
<p class="src">Source: NC, "Launch Rewards", posted Oct 4, 2026 on Steam. Last checked ${LAST}.</p></div>`,{og:'guide-launch-rewards'});
page('/guides/twitch-drops','Aion 2 Twitch Drops: Link, Watch and Claim Rewards','Learn the official Aion 2 Twitch Drops flow for Global: link the right platform account, watch participating channels, claim in Twitch, and fix missing rewards.',[...H,['Guides','/guides'],['Twitch Drops Guide','/guides/twitch-drops']],`
<div class="split-intro"><div class="page-intro"><span class="section-kicker">Global account flow</span><h1>Aion 2 Twitch Drops</h1><p>Use the official campaign page for the current reward list and dates. This guide covers the stable part of the flow: linking the correct platform account, tracking progress and claiming the reward.</p><div class="ctas"><a class="cta pri" href="${official.twitch}" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Open official Drops page ↗</a><a class="cta" href="${official.twitchNotice}" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Read NC notice ↗</a></div></div>${mediaFigure(screenshots.raidGroup,'Promotional group encounter; not a reward screen.','intro-media')}</div>
<section class="status-banner caution"><div><span class="status-dot"></span><span><b>Campaign details can change</b><small>Rewards and end dates belong to the official page, not this static guide.</small></span></div><time datetime="2026-10-23">Source check · Oct 23, 2026</time></section>
<section class="article-grid"><article class="doc"><h2>Link the account you actually play</h2><ol class="steps-num"><li><span>Open the official AION 2 Twitch Drops page and sign in to the NC account used for Global.</span></li><li><span>Choose the platform path that matches your client. If you play through Steam, select the <strong>Steam icon</strong> during linking.</span></li><li><span>Complete the Twitch authorization and return to the official page.</span></li><li><span>Use <strong>My Page → Manage Login</strong> on the AION 2 site to check the connection before watching.</span></li></ol><h2>Watch and claim</h2><ol class="steps-num"><li><span>Open a participating channel while the campaign is in its published window.</span></li><li><span>Progress can accumulate across participating channels; check the Drops campaign page in Twitch.</span></li><li><span>When the requirement is complete, claim the item in <strong>Twitch Drops &amp; Rewards Inventory</strong>.</span></li><li><span>Return to the game and check the delivery destination named by the current campaign notice.</span></li></ol></article><aside class="aside-note"><span class="section-kicker">Scope</span><h2>Global only</h2><p>The official linking page says this Global campaign does not apply to the Korean or Taiwan services.</p><h3>If progress is stuck</h3><ul><li>Check that the channel is marked as participating.</li><li>Check the connected Twitch and platform accounts.</li><li>Claim on Twitch before looking in game.</li><li>Re-read the current campaign window and reward-delivery note.</li></ul></aside></section>
<section class="source-strip"><span>Primary sources</span><a href="${official.twitch}" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Official Drops connection page ↗</a><a href="${official.twitchNotice}" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">NC campaign notice ↗</a><time datetime="2026-10-23">Checked Oct 23, 2026</time></section>`,{noindex:true});

